## 3. Linked libraries & build-time dependencies (`src/`, `apps/`, `tools/`)

The FinnOS C++20 userland (`finn-comp`, `finn-session`, `libfinnui`, `finnplatformtheme`, `finnstyle`, `finn-shell`, native apps, and `tools/`) compiles and dynamically links against the following upstream components:

| Component | Used by | License (standard upstream SPDX) |
|---|---|---|
| **Qt6** (`qt6-base`, `qt6-wayland`, `qt6-svg`, `qt6-imageformats`, `qt6-tools`, `qt6-declarative`) | `libfinnui`, `src/qtplugin`, `finn-shell`, `apps/*`, `tools/finn-cursors` | `LGPL-3.0-only` OR `GPL-2.0-or-later` OR `GPL-3.0-only` |
| **Qt6 WebEngine** (`qt6-webengine`, embeds Chromium/Blink/V8/FFmpeg) | `apps/flourish` (`CMakeLists.txt` optional in `apps/CMakeLists.txt`) | `LGPL-3.0-only` / `GPL-3.0-only` + Chromium third-party licenses (`BSD-3-Clause`, `MIT`, `MPL-2.0`, etc.) |
| **LayerShellQt** (`layer-shell-qt`) | `libfinnui`, `finn-shell`, `finn-wallpaper` | `LGPL-3.0-or-later` AND `BSD-3-Clause` |
| **wlroots 0.20** (`wlroots-0.20`) | `finn-comp` | `MIT` |
| **Wayland** (`wayland-server`, `wayland-client`, `wayland-protocols`, `wayland-scanner`) | `finn-comp`, `finn-shell`, Qt6 Wayland | `MIT` |
| **libxkbcommon** (`xkbcommon`) | `finn-comp` | `MIT` |
| **Pixman** (`pixman-1`) | `finn-comp` | `MIT` |
| **libxcb** (`xcb`) | `finn-comp` (Xwayland) | `MIT` |
| **systemd / libsystemd** (`systemd`) | `finn-comp` (`sd_notify`, watchdog), `finn-shell` (`logind` D-Bus), session units | `LGPL-2.1-or-later` AND `GPL-2.0-or-later` |

