## 4. Shipped base OS & distribution packages (`base/packages.x86_64`, `base/packages.aarch64`, `base/boot/`, `base/mkfinniso`)

FinnOS install media and target root filesystems are constructed from Arch Linux / Arch Linux ARM packages via `mkarchiso`, `pacman`, and `arch-install-scripts`. Corresponding license files for installed package versions reside at `/usr/share/licenses/<package>/` on any built image. Because this repository is audited on a non-Arch host without an unpacked rootfs, package-level licenses not directly inspected in-tree are noted honestly; packages whose exact Arch packaging license files have not been inspected from a built image are marked `UNVERIFIED` for exact sub-licenses.

### Core OS, Kernel, Boot, and Firmware
| Package / Component | Role in FinnOS | License |
|---|---|---|
| **Linux kernel** (`linux`, `linux-aarch64`) | Operating system kernel | `GPL-2.0-only` (with `Linux-syscall-note`) |
| **systemd**, `systemd-sysvcompat` | Init system, service manager, `logind`, `systemd-boot` | `LGPL-2.1-or-later` / `GPL-2.0-or-later` |
| **Plymouth** (`plymouth`) | Initramfs boot splash (`finnos` theme) | `GPL-2.0-or-later` |
| **GRUB** (`grub`), `efibootmgr` | UEFI/BIOS bootloader for installed systems & ISO | `GPL-3.0-or-later` (`grub`); `GPL-2.0-or-later` (`efibootmgr`) |
| **Syslinux** (ISO BIOS boot, `base/boot/syslinux/`) | BIOS ISO bootloader via `mkarchiso` | `GPL-2.0-or-later` |
| **pacman**, **archiso**, **mkinitcpio-archiso**, **arch-install-scripts** | Package manager, live ISO builder, chroot/pacstrap tooling | `GPL-2.0-or-later` |
| `linux-firmware` | GPU, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth device firmware | Redistributable vendor firmware licenses (`UNVERIFIED` per-blob sub-licenses until inspected in `/usr/share/licenses/linux-firmware/`) |
| `intel-ucode` | Intel CPU microcode updates (`x86_64`) | Intel Proprietary Redistributable (`UNVERIFIED` exact text until inspected in `/usr/share/licenses/intel-ucode/`) |
| `amd-ucode` | AMD CPU microcode updates (`x86_64`) | AMD Redistributable (`UNVERIFIED` exact text until inspected in `/usr/share/licenses/amd-ucode/`) |
| `base`, `sudo`, `util-linux`, `kbd` | Core Linux base, privilege escalation, console utilities | Mixed (`GPL-2.0-or-later`, `ISC`, etc. — `UNVERIFIED` per-member from host) |

